# Phase 3B: Secure Wallet Vault — Implementation Report

The Phase 3B security architecture has been fully implemented and verified through comprehensive unit testing. The vault layer now securely encrypts, stores, decrypts, and deletes the wallet payload according to the strict cryptographic specification.

As requested, this implementation contains **no UI integration** and acts purely as the secure foundation.

